                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "My parents had moved to this house, which sat on the border of Corktown and Mexicantown, from their tiny apartment in Ann Arbor—once they found out that their little oops was actually two little oops."
                                            }
